# SecLLM (local inference control plane) — Ubuntu/Debian. Normally secdeploy GENERATES this
# file (with a random admin token) from `deploy ubuntu --with-inference`; this example is for
# reference / manual runs, or hosts that install SecLLM outside secdeploy's automation.
SECLLM_HOST=0.0.0.0
SECLLM_PORT=11400
SECLLM_BACKEND=vllm
# REQUIRED in production: set a strong admin token (secdeploy generates one automatically).
SECLLM_ADMIN_TOKEN=
# Autostart model(s) at boot instead of lazy first-request load — comma-separated catalog ids
# (not a boolean), e.g.:
# SECLLM_AUTOSTART=fast,reasoning
